<title>JAPAN: Central Bk of Tunisia launches 20-yr samurai-Nikko.</title>
<headline>Central Bk of Tunisia launches 20-yr samurai-Nikko.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai issue was announced by lead manager Nikko Securities on Thursday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  Central Bank of Tunisia</p>
<p> AMT		 10 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    4.35 pct</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> MATURITY	  15 August 2017</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  15 August 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	August 7 to August 11</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P BBB-, Moody's Baa3</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Nikko Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Nippon Credit Bank</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
